  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.Menu.OpeningTitle>动物菜单，{0} 只动物</RimWorldAccess.Animals.Menu.OpeningTitle>
  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.Menu.Closed>动物菜单已关闭</RimWorldAccess.Animals.Menu.Closed>
