  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.Paint.Bulk.CellApplied>已将 {2} 的 {0} 设为 {1}</RimWorldAccess.Animals.Paint.Bulk.CellApplied>
  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.Paint.Bulk.CellAlreadyAll>所有动物的 {0} 已是 {1}</RimWorldAccess.Animals.Paint.Bulk.CellAlreadyAll>

