  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.Wildlife.Menu.CannotTame>无法驯服此动物</RimWorldAccess.Animals.Wildlife.Menu.CannotTame>

  <!-- Bulk paint phrasing for wildlife (only Hunt/Tame are paintable).
