  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.AutoSlaughter.Column.MaxMalesYoung>最大允许未成年雄性数量</RimWorldAccess.Animals.AutoSlaughter.Column.MaxMalesYoung>
  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.AutoSlaughter.Column.MaxFemales>最大允许雌性数量</RimWorldAccess.Animals.AutoSlaughter.Column.MaxFemales>
  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.AutoSlaughter.Column.MaxFemalesYoung>最大允许未成年雌性数量</RimWorldAccess.Animals.AutoSlaughter.Column.MaxFemalesYoung>
