  <RimWorldAccess.Animals.AutoSlaughter.Numeric.Cancelled>已取消</RimWorldAccess.Animals.AutoSlaughter.Numeric.Cancelled>

  <!-- Auto-slaughter partial cell shapes (single-axis announcements).
       NameWithoutColumn: {0} = animal, {1} = value, {2} = position.
